Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.41,0:00:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.51,0:00:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was the joke that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.46,0:00:26.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.66,0:00:37.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.32,0:00:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没听见 你得大声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't quite catch that. You're gonna have to speak up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.46,0:00:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not today…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.49,0:00:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不在明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}…not tomorrow…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.79,0:01:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I'm gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.96,0:01:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.34,0:01:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,西蒙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simon…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.24,0:01:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有什么 一把刀吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}what did he have, a knife?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.48,0:01:27.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有一把短斧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, he had a hatchet.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.45,0:01:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,一把短斧\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hatchet?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.09,0:01:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有一把斧子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had an ax.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.84,0:01:40.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,西蒙是我的左右手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simon's my right-hand man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.92,0:01:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,有左右手是很重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Having one of those is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.58,0:01:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了他们 你会剩下什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what do you have left without them?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.54,0:01:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,许多工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whole lot of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.32,0:01:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有左右手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.30,0:01:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是这里还活着的一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe one of these fine people still breathing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.38,0:02:01.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or did I…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.80,0:02:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.61,0:02:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.25,0:02:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他的斧子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me his ax.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.23,0:02:59.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.19,0:03:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许瑞克会跟我一起回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe Rick will be with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.78,0:03:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if not, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.52,0:03:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以将他们扒皮抽骨 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can just turn these people inside out, won't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.81,0:03:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 剩下的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean… the ones that are left.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.18,0:04:03.39,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.18,0:04:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去兜兜风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go for a ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.66,0:04:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a piece of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.33,0:04:44.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我要杀了你」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I'm gonna kill you."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.04,0:04:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kiddin' me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.17,0:04:51.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看见刚发生的事了吗 我做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see what just happened, what I just did?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.73,0:04:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.64,0:04:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好的机会是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your best chance…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.80,0:05:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,站起来 拿起那把斧子\N{\fnArial\fs30}is to stand up, grab that ax,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.73,0:05:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,砍穿我的后脑勺\N{\fnArial\fs30}and drive it through the back of my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.13,0:05:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}See how you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.98,0:05:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,继续装硬汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep actin' tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.82,0:05:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.30,0:05:17.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿起斧子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab the damn ax.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.24,0:05:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.55,0:05:48.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我再起身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me get up again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.89,0:05:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.30,0:05:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,快破晓了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn is breakin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.53,0:06:01.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,又是全新的一天 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a brand-new day, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.09,0:06:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要你想想可能发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to think about what could have happened…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.46,0:06:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}…think about what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.59,0:06:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想还可能发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and think about what can still happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.58,0:06:40.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,砰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.97,0:06:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那让你想到你认识的人了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That remind you of anybody you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.32,0:06:48.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.67,0:07:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.33,0:07:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里的人 他们是我的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The people back there … they are mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.06,0:07:22.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,这\N{\fnArial\fs30}This…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.87,0:07:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这也是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.81,0:07:53.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Rick…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.43,0:07:56.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,去捡我的斧子\N{\fnArial\fs30}go get my ax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.94,0:07:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's be friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.55,0:08:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,去捡我的斧子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get my ax.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.45,0:11:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你们一定都以为你们会一起变老\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet you thought you were all gonna grow old together,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.02,0:11:14.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,周日晚上围坐在桌边一起吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}sittin' around the table at Sunday dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.57,0:11:16.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此幸福地生活在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.48,0:11:18.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.28,0:11:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是那么回事 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't work like that, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.95,0:11:27.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.65,0:11:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是无法决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I simply cannot decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.44,0:11:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.35,0:12:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eenie…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.25,0:12:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}meenie…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.38,0:12:14.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,点\N{\fnArial\fs30}miney…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.90,0:12:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,将\N{\fnArial\fs30}mo…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.09,0:12:19.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,骑\N{\fnArial\fs30}catch…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.12,0:12:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}a tiger…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.32,0:12:26.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,打\N{\fnArial\fs30}by…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.04,0:12:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,仗\N{\fnArial\fs30}his toe.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.63,0:12:30.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,点到\N{\fnArial\fs30}If…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.89,0:12:33.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}he hollers…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.47,0:12:37.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪里就上\N{\fnArial\fs30}let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.81,0:12:40.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,头\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mother…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.31,0:12:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,破\N{\fnArial\fs30}told me…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.52,0:12:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,血\N{\fnArial\fs30}to pick…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.43,0:12:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,流\N{\fnArial\fs30}the very…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.02,0:12:53.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,死\N{\fnArial\fs30}best one…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.02,0:12:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,在\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.57,0:13:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,场\N{\fnArial\fs30}are…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.81,0:13:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,上\N{\fnArial\fs30}it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.38,0:13:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人敢动或说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody moves, anybody says anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.40,0:13:34.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就把那孩子的另一只眼挖出来喂他父亲吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}cut the boy's other eye out and feed it to his father,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.19,0:13:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们再开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then we'll start.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.25,0:13:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以呼吸 你可以眨眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can breathe. You can blink.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.79,0:13:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以哭泣\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.27,0:13:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 你们每个人都会那样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, you're all gonna be doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.36,0:13:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.07,0:13:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有种\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taking it like a champ!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.08,0:13:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suck…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.32,0:13:59.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}my…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.41,0:14:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}nuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.90,0:14:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们听见了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.54,0:14:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,他让我滚蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said, "suck my nuts."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.72,0:14:58.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.77,0:15:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.81,0:15:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家伙儿们 瞧瞧我肮脏的坏女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys, look at my dirty girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.40,0:15:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,小甜心…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetheart…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.53,0:15:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lay your eyes on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.03,0:15:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.41,0:15:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you …
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.75,0:15:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你俩是一对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were you together?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.47,0:15:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,真惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}That sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.98,0:15:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,假如你俩真是一对 你就应该知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you were, you should know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.48,0:15:43.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都是有原因的\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was a reason for all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.32,0:15:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,红毛 该死的 他过去是 现在是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Red … and hell, he was, is,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.25,0:15:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,将来也永远会是红的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and will ever be red.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.29,0:15:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为你们团队里的一人 或六人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just took one or six.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.40,0:15:51.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至是七人挡了一劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}or seven for the team!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.25,0:15:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 仔细 看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}So take…a damn look.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.58,0:16:05.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a damn look!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.17,0:16:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.20,0:16:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.16,0:16:18.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}That?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.82,0:16:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.02,0:16:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}That…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.12,0:16:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不可取\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a no-no.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.23,0:16:39.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这整件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}The whole thing …
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.71,0:16:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,绝对不允许出现任何类似的行为\N{\fnArial\fs30}not one bit of that shit flies here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.57,0:16:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想我动手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want me to do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.57,0:16:54.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就地正法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.98,0:17:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.09,0:17:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不能杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't kill them…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.86,0:17:07.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能这么轻易地杀了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}not until you try a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.34,0:17:20.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,话说回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And anyway…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.14,0:17:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,规矩不是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's not how it works.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.62,0:17:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经告诉过你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I already told you people …
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.84,0:17:30.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}first one's free,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.98,0:17:31.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我还说了什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}then what'd I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.65,0:17:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说我会弄死你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I would shut that shit down!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.15,0:17:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}No exceptions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.90,0:17:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你们之前都是在和\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't know what kind of lying assholes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.91,0:17:43.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么样的骗子打交道\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've been dealing with…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.87,0:17:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我是个讲信用的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}…but I'm a man of my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.83,0:17:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一印象很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}First impressions are important.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.62,0:17:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们了解我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to know me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.98,0:18:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.06,0:18:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,重新再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}…back to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.54,0:18:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.20,0:18:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你还有知觉吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Buddy, you still there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.98,0:18:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.69,0:18:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像你想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems like you're trying to speak,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.44,0:18:45.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你刚中了一棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you just took a hell of a hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.73,0:18:47.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我砸你脑袋太用力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just popped your skull so hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.84,0:18:49.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你眼球都爆出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}your eyeball just popped out,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.44,0:18:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是恶心死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it is gross as shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.05,0:18:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬 我会找到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie, I'll find you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.01,0:19:11.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.69,0:19:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,能看出来这对你们来说太残酷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can see this is hard on you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.77,0:19:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.49,0:19:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,真心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I truly am.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.87,0:19:28.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我确实说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I did say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.72,0:19:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有例外\N{\fnArial\fs30}No exceptions!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.14,0:20:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这帮孬种\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bunch of pussies.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.81,0:20:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才刚开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just getting started.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.94,0:20:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,露西尔很饥渴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lucille is thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.44,0:20:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是根嗜血的球棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is a vampire bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.19,0:20:51.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.27,0:20:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好笑吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was the joke that bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.31,0:20:59.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们死了 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}People died, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.43,0:21:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那确实发生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.61,0:21:04.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不代表其他人也要去死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't mean the rest of them have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.54,0:21:08.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的斧子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me my ax.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.22,0:21:13.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的 斧子 给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get me…my…ax!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.11,0:21:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你行 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were the guy, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.14,0:21:26.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许你不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.11,0:21:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,再给你一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll give it one more go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.16,0:21:32.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在真心希望你再试一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I really want you to try this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.78,0:21:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后一次机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.28,0:21:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的斧子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring me my ax!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.88,0:22:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间不等人 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clock is ticking, Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.09,0:22:36.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想还可能发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about what can still happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.04,0:24:16.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,真乖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attaboy!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.77,0:25:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're here, prick.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.72,0:25:17.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定不好受对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}This must be hard for you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.13,0:25:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直以来你都是最强者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you have been King Shit for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.80,0:25:31.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞬间失去两个自己人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Losin' two of your own like…
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.30,0:25:37.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,被那样殴杀 一个接着一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gettin' 'em clipped like that, one nut, then the other,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.68,0:25:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,还当着你儿子的面\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in front of your boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.95,0:25:43.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,那真是糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is some screwed-up shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.18,0:25:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goody.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.50,0:26:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前是老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.47,0:26:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.29,0:26:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you were probably…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.72,0:26:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,当上瘾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}addicted to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.23,0:26:18.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.86,0:26:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,啪啪两下 就结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}clip, clip … that's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.74,0:26:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.26,0:26:31.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是可以为我服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you can still lead…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.44,0:26:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,过上美好殷实的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}a nice, productive life producing for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.84,0:26:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你会需要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you're gonna need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.27,0:26:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just got a feelin'.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.52,0:27:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么拿去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.55,0:27:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.86,0:27:29.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我问你 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me ask you something, Rick …
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.76,0:27:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道那段小旅行的意义吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you even know what that little trip was about?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.93,0:27:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你说你就说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak when you're spoken to.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.25,0:27:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.22,0:27:55.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那旅行的意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}That trip was about.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.53,0:27:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,在于你看我的眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}at you looked at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.07,0:28:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想改变你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.50,0:28:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要你明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted you to understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.96,0:28:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你还是用那同样该死的眼神看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're still looking at me the same damn way…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.22,0:28:11.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我在你的煎蛋里拉屎了一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}…like I shit in your scrambled eggs,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.54,0:28:13.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是不行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that's not gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.74,0:28:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.47,0:28:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要再给你一次机会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…do I give you another chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.60,0:28:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.70,0:28:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.39,0:28:33.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.05,0:28:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.82,0:28:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.20,0:28:44.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就开始吧 超级大奖赛\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here it is … the grand-prize game.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.40,0:28:49.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你接下来做出的选择 会决定这糟糕的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you do next will decide whether your crap day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.64,0:28:53.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,会变成大家最后糟糕的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}becomes everyone's last crap day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.05,0:28:56.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是说只是普通糟糕的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}or just another crap day.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.06,0:29:01.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,用枪指着他们的头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some guns to the back of their heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.39,0:29:14.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. Now…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.74,0:29:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他们鼻子齐平 这样一开枪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}level with their noses, so if you have to fire…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.72,0:29:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,那画面会很惨烈\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'll be a real mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.44,0:29:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.26,0:29:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.00,0:29:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kid…now.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.39,0:29:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是左撇子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a southpaw?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.26,0:30:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I a what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.77,0:30:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你惯用左手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You a lefty?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.26,0:30:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.45,0:30:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.67,0:30:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,疼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.63,0:30:15.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.05,0:30:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.84,0:30:20.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该觉得疼\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.77,0:30:22.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.58,0:30:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴在地上 孩子 趴在爸爸边上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get down on the ground, kid, next to Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.06,0:30:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,展开双手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spread them wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.65,0:30:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,西蒙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simon…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.69,0:30:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有笔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you got a pen?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.30,0:30:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.60,0:31:02.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.82,0:31:06.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这会凉得像巫师的阴囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna be as cold as a warlock's ballsack,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.53,0:31:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,好像他在你上面挺着阴囊\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like he was hanging his ballsack above you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.93,0:31:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后拖过你的前臂\N{\fnArial\fs30}and dragging it right across the forearm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.80,0:31:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.22,0:31:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你留一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gives you a little leverage.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.93,0:31:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.44,0:31:19.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.99,0:31:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.40,0:31:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,求我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.80,0:31:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么都不会干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't doing shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.37,0:31:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 我要你拿起斧头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, I want you to take your ax…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.15,0:31:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,砍下你儿子的左臂\N{\fnArial\fs30}cut your son's left arm off,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.58,0:31:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就顺着那条线\N{\fnArial\fs30}right on that line.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.90,0:31:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I know … I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.07,0:31:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要花点时间接受这个信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to process that for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.10,0:31:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是正常的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.72,0:31:50.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 我还是要你动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, though, I'm gonna need you to do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.79,0:31:53.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然其他人就得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}or all these people are gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.74,0:31:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后卡尔也要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Carl dies,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.40,0:31:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,家里的那些人也要死\N{\fnArial\fs30}then the people back home die…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.47,0:32:01.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后 你也得死\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you, eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.25,0:32:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会让你苟活个几年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna keep you breathing for a few years,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.12,0:32:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你备受煎熬\N{\fnArial\fs30}just so you can stew on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.22,0:32:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你不用这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You … you don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.88,0:32:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.12,0:32:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.80,0:32:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.39,0:32:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.67,0:32:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不确定瑞克明不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure that Rick does.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.40,0:32:21.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你干脆利落地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need a clean cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.07,0:32:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺着那条线砍\N{\fnArial\fs30}right there on that line.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.68,0:32:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这样要求很过分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I know this is a screwed-up thing to ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.79,0:32:27.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你得砍成像意大利香肠片一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's gonna have to be like a salami slice …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.98,0:32:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,切口齐整 干净 45度角\N{\fnArial\fs30}nothing messy, clean, 45 degrees …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.62,0:32:32.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好让我们缝合伤口\N{\fnArial\fs30}give us something to fold over.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.45,0:32:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有个好医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got a great doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.82,0:32:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子不会有事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kid'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.96,0:32:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,大概吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.35,0:32:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.17,0:32:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须现在就做\N{\fnArial\fs30}…this needs to happen now …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.61,0:32:46.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}chop, chop …
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.45,0:32:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我亲自砸烂这小子的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}or I will crush the little fella's skull myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.88,0:32:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以换我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can … It can … It can be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.70,0:32:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以换我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.71,0:32:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以砍我的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Y-You can do it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.73,0:33:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以跟你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I c… I can go with … with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.83,0:33:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.41,0:33:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是唯一的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the only way.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.49,0:33:07.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.01,0:33:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿起斧子\N{\fnArial\fs30}pick up the ax.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.99,0:33:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不做决定也是个大决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not making a decision is a big decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.92,0:33:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真想看这些人都死吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really want to see all these people die?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.65,0:33:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.17,0:33:27.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会看到每个肮脏的细节\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will see every ugly thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.74,0:33:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.74,0:33:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要逼我倒数吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna make me count?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.54,0:33:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.07,0:33:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You win.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.98,0:33:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我数\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.90,0:33:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 三 - 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 3! - Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.06,0:33:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.96,0:33:45.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以换我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.50,0:33:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.39,0:33:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,二\N{\fnArial\fs30}2!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.47,0:33:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't do …
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.88,0:33:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间要到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.71,0:34:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一\N{\fnArial\fs30}1.?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.79,0:34:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 砍吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad… just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.25,0:34:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,砍吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.44,0:34:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.46,0:34:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听我号令\N{\fnArial\fs30}You answer to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.85,0:34:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你向我上贡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You provide for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.23,0:34:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你属于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.53,0:34:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.49,0:34:40.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你说你就说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speak when you're spoken to!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.88,0:34:43.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听我号令\N{\fnArial\fs30}You answer to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.67,0:34:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你向我上贡\N{\fnArial\fs30}You provide for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.04,0:34:46.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,向你上贡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Provide for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.69,0:34:50.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你属于我 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You belong to me, right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.60,0:34:52.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.81,0:34:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.86,0:35:00.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,这…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.70,0:35:03.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我想看到的眼神\N{\fnArial\fs30}…is the look I wanted to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.95,0:35:16.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.19,0:35:20.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们所有人 齐心协力\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of us, together…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.80,0:35:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至包括地上趴着的死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}even the dead guys on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.24,0:35:25.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 他们肯定要得精神奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, they get the spirit award, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.95,0:35:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是他妈高效的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today was a productive damn day!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.14,0:35:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我希望 为了你们好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I hope, for all your sake…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.90,0:35:41.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you get it now…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.92,0:35:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们理解事情的运作方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that you understand how things work.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.23,0:35:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切已改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.04,0:35:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你们以前怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you had going for you…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.25,0:36:00.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在都已结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that is over now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.85,0:36:04.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,德怀特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah. Dwight…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.80,0:36:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,拉他上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}…load him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.85,0:36:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有种\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's got guts …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:30.74,0:36:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像我认识的某个小婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}not a little bitch like someone I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.66,0:36:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.83,0:36:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他现在是我的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's mine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.17,0:36:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果你还想打鬼主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you still want to try something?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.94,0:36:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不在今天 不在明天」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Not today, not tomorrow."
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.21,0:36:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,「不在今天 不在明天」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Not today, not tomorrow"?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.37,0:36:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会砍下一部分…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will cut pieces off of…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.08,0:36:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他叫什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.77,0:36:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.85,0:36:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,听上去还挺搭的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That actually sounds right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.90,0:36:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会切下达里尔的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will cut pieces off of Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.35,0:36:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后放到你的门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}and put them on your doorstep …
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.14,0:37:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者 更棒的是 我把他带到你面前\N{\fnArial\fs30}or, better yet, I will bring him to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.92,0:37:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你来替我动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}and have you do it for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.26,0:37:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到全新的开始 你们这些可怜虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to a brand-new beginning, you sorry shits!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.52,0:37:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给你们一辆货车\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna leave you a truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.00,0:37:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,留着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.01,0:37:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,用来装你们给我弄到的各种物资\N{\fnArial\fs30}Use it to cart all the crap you're gonna find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.53,0:37:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会在一周后来收取第一次的贡品\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be back for our first offering in one week.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.11,0:37:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until then…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.56,0:37:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}ta-ta.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.10,0:39:25.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬 玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie. Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.70,0:39:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie…
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.25,0:39:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}you need to sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.61,0:39:37.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 玛姬 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maggie. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.94,0:39:42.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要把你送去山顶寨\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get you to the Hilltop.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.67,0:39:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得去做好准备\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to go get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.51,0:39:45.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.64,0:39:50.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,抗击他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}To fight them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.84,0:40:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们手里有达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.11,0:40:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有一支军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have an army.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.52,0:40:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会死的 全都会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would die … all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.30,0:40:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.00,0:40:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,把大家都带回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take everybody with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.66,0:40:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以一个人去那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can get there by myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.54,0:40:18.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你站都站不稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can barely stand up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.79,0:40:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.54,0:40:22.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你需要回亚历山大去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to go to Alexandria.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.31,0:40:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是为了我才出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were out … out here for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.75,0:40:36.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在依然是\N{\fnArial\fs30}We still are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.10,0:40:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在一个人可以去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can make it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.27,0:40:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你们回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.36,0:40:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能让你们在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't have you out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.54,0:40:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能再让你们在外面冒险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't have you all out here anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.68,0:40:55.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你们回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.18,0:41:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.70,0:41:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会让你一个人走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're not letting you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.07,0:41:09.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.64,0:41:10.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须让我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.74,0:41:14.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not gonna happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.57,0:41:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带着她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking her.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.87,0:41:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会送她去那里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get her there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.57,0:41:32.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会保护她的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna keep her safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:38.29,0:41:39.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我由不得你拒绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not giving you a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.49,0:41:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带着他一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking him with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.78,0:42:04.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要带上他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna take him.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.45,0:42:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm gonna do.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.59,0:42:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须这么做 拜托了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to do this. Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.65,0:42:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.52,0:42:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.61,0:42:38.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.01,0:42:41.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.08,0:42:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 让我们帮忙吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pl… Pl… Please let us.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.32,0:42:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我们的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He… He's our family, t…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.78,0:42:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也是我们的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's our family, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.10,0:43:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 数到三\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. On three.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.19,0:43:11.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二\N{\fnArial\fs30}1, 2…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.83,0:43:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你们一定都以为你们会一起变老\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bet you thought you were all gonna grow old together,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.30,0:43:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,周日晚上围坐在桌边一起吃饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}sittin' around the table at Sunday dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.85,0:43:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此幸福地生活在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the happily ever after.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.63,0:43:37.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.53,0:43:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是那么回事 瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't work like that, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.76,0:43:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不再是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
